AI learning unhealthy stereotypes
  After looking at data and text on the internet, AI can learn sterotypes and produce this
    Man:Woman as Father:? -> Mother
    Man:Woman as King:? -> Queen
    Man:Computer Programmer as Woman:? -> Homemaker --> Compter Porgrammer (Better Answer)

Why Bias Matters
    Hiring tool that discriminated against women 
    Facial recognition working better for lightskinned than darkskinned individuals
    Bank loan approvals
    Toxic effect of reinforcing unhealthy sterotypes

Combating Bias
    Technical solutions: 
        Ex. "zero out" the bias in words
        use less biased and/or more inclusive data
    Transparency and/or auditing processes
    Diverse workforce
        Creates less biased applications
